    <briefdescription>
<para>Reports results of every CS handover subevent within the CS procedure. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>When the number of steps exceeds the maximum HCI event size, the controller may report further results for the CS subevent using the <ref refid="group__sl__bt__evt__cs__handover__result__continue" kindref="compound">sl_bt_evt_cs_handover_result_continue</ref> event. This event is intended for the CS Follower role. </para>
